": "object_left_avatar_v2.png", "id": "316326717930205", "image_type": "APP_IMG_IMMERSIVE_LAYER_OBJECT_LEFT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223470_316326721263538_851375230247779122_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mLd9rxMaPVQQ7kNvwHQmi_-&_nc_oc=AdqZ5PCs3bkNd8d1XKo6Awl76nbc84Lpg43v0EWay-01sJ9rsWkIm82eZ7Q0wZOO9DY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA09cFeJEwlNZ4tbQ4hz84RG0DS7jSCs6LpHt6vV_s6Sw&oe=6A539D92"}]}, "id": "1040681908923483", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "2024 Product Page Screenshots - 6 (1).png", "id": "3629811947307678", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974778_3629811950641011_1325301661716721494_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O7-0-_xo4JoQ7kNvwHJ2o4q&_nc_oc=AdpzdP89H7n1Q9rqka6ldpgCHnxDHQqwIg06mjvgVYiFTDOtmHdu-m2KVMpIJ72AFFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAxEyi5rXtgVh3n1aJDe1YK9CQY3d4Lehz-zNV2ZNwBPQ&oe=6A538016"}, {"file_name": "2024 Product Page Screenshots - 4.png", "id": "1509356679853452", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974853_1509356683186785_245496980552221799_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cb1Wc07ZfigQ7kNvwHzzeDl&_nc_oc=AdoQv311Q6ZjMKmKeMNAG527wK84vt0e_ozL0pr0Vyw1YiurUh7JaoaGxt7SoC5lxCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBHU1_EcUc2czwl1XN5IzjyDXzWoOluHz6bGRFWVQcC_A&oe=6A53973D"}, {"file_name": "Frame 189.png", "id": "1173198738099613", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301053_1173198741432946_5471565925352056225_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0dhvtloumdIQ7kNvwERIupn&_nc_oc=AdrabS2csZ80oC_TVGRRXqOf0PTh-MsyxY3kXPI_RauEevIutjZT073EORl-ymh_mQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD_T0PhkNzMeioKkYigkwJUIpAh_xr9V7_fZGf7jTOXLg&oe=6A53893B"}, {"file_name": "New Screenshot.png", "id": "1383205436302268", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619809_1383205442968934_4795206938435697675_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CjiQW6vr_Y0Q7kNvwHUEGFC&_nc_oc=AdoyX9XL8jmg0YLfMasGyRtMuIXqquJ5fbPxQqmmVxBCwA7TE9J5cKViKBPRlWYkkWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBqiLYCbVbQ2BRgA_MTvi0vPqT5fJTI3FDvD9Ucc5IruQ&oe=6A539D6E"}, {"file_name": "2024 Product Page Screenshots - 8.png", "id": "937941248048494", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982608_937941251381827_4208153383432172814_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0QPY6FZvsR4Q7kNvwGVA6YZ&_nc_oc=AdpAb8yZ33myfJ_A3rZNDAnCrefwfRGQwLdzLpopxD2tUAkDUUrCfOX2GVryewcWUq8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDZNva_3sYUWmBiPs7XoqcdpBh3i6zGvx9cj2UPudFaiw&oe=6A53AA72"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Frame 188.png", "id": "1438063261419236", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299715_1438063264752569_4670437817028551912_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KpBBQmA1w40Q7kNvwFUh7v1&_nc_oc=Adpy0NuCmkjD6-jhg4nr36dBkfX7w0tg9j2ePfMpIbEPVTWWLUxe86Rn5ZSZ0Gf00Dw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBu4GuMmyRmsoiyi0P4EmCImRZOR4IYljPP3Ngk7zyPfA&oe=6A5387F7"}, "display_name": "Gym Class", "keywords": ["basketball", "nba", "boxing", "football", "baseball"], "long_description": "**GYM CLASS is the #1 best rated sports game on Meta Quest** - play basketball, boxing, football, soccer, baseball, & paintball with realistic physics & massive multiplayer worlds.  \ud83c\udfc0\ud83e\udd4a\ud83c\udfc8\u26bd\u26be\ud83c\udfa8\n\nExperience NBA-licensed team courts and player jerseys, MLB-licensed ballparks and uniforms. Hang with friends, compete, & unlock gear. With weekly updates, there\u2019s always something new in Gym Class VR.\n\n{845878341488272}\n\n**Download FREE today:** \n- \u2705  **Realistic VR Physics**: bring real-life moves to shooting, boxing, dribbling, dunking, pitching, & batting.\n- \ud83c\udfae  **Multiplayer + AI**: compete with friends, meet new players, or practice with AI\n- \ud83c\udf0d  **Massive Worlds**: socialize, explore, & play in large environments built for VR\n- \ud83c\udfc0\u26be\ud83c\udfc8  **Instant Gear**: spawn balls, gloves, & gadgets anywhere\n- \ud83c\udfaf **Challenges + Unlocks**: earn hoodies, jerseys, suits, hats, glasses, mascots, \u201cgreen\u201d effects, gadgets, & more\n\n{1193253625573297}\n\n**NBA Bundle unlocks:**\n- \ud83d\ude2e **30 NBA team Courts**: Virtual replicas of all 30 NBA team courts in arenas & training facilities.\n- \ud83c\udfc6 **NBA team gear**: team apparel sets, ball, and hat - unlock more by playing\n\n{969686844967912}\n\n**MLB Bundle unlocks:**\n- \u26be **30 MLB Ballparks**: 30 MLB branded ballparks with roaring crowds.\n- \ud83d\udc55 **Official Uniforms**: Home & away jerseys, cap & helmet for your favorite MLB club.\n\n{1174479781362169}\n\n**GC PRO unlocks:**\n- \ud83c\udfe0 **Private Servers**: Custom lobbies to play w/ friends\n- \ud83d\udc55 **Full-body Avatars**: customize face details, hair, body shape, height, tattoos, & facial hair..\n- \ud83e\udd16 **PRO Challenges**: premium cosmetic challenges.\n\n{557813239965509}", "short_description": "GYM CLASS is the top VR sports (\ud83c\udfc0 basketball, \ud83e\udd4a boxing, \ud83c\udfc8 football, \u26bdsoccer, \u26be baseball, \ud83c\udfa8 paintball) game. Experience NBA licensed team courts & jerseys, MLB licensed ballparks & uniforms, multiplayer games, simulation physics, and massive worlds. Rated best on Quest - make friends or level-up to be the best among millions in the top VR sports community."}]}, "developer_name": "IRL Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gymclass.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://gymclass.com/tos", "publisher_name": "IRL Studios", "support_website_url": "https://gymclass.com/support", "website_url": "https://g